<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Gerência de Eventos</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: var(--surface); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
    .logo-icon { color: var(--accent); }
    .topbar-nav { display: flex; gap: 0.25rem; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-nav a { color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.15s; }
    .topbar-nav a:hover, .topbar-nav a.active { color: var(--text); background: var(--surface-hover); }
    .session-pill { padding: 0.42rem 0.78rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: 999px; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .btn-logout { background: transparent; color: var(--danger); border: 1px solid var(--danger-border); font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-secondary { background:var(--surface-hover); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background:var(--surface-hover); }
    .main-content { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; }
    .danger-card { background:var(--warn-subtle); border: 2px solid var(--warn-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .danger-card h1 { color: var(--warn); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .danger-card p { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .danger-card .warning { color: var(--warn); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .danger-card .error-msg { color: var(--danger); background:var(--danger-subtle); border: 1px solid var(--danger-border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .file-drop { background:var(--surface-elevated); border: 2px dashed var(--warn-border); color: var(--text); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .file-drop:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--warn); }
    .danger-input { background:var(--surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--warn-border); color: var(--text); padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1rem; width: 300px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .danger-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--warn); }
    .btn-warn { background:var(--warn-subtle); color: var(--warn); border: 2px solid var(--warn-border); padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .btn-warn:hover { background:var(--warn-subtle); }
    .btn-warn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .btn-back { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .btn-back:hover { color: var(--text); }
  </style>
  <%- include('../partials/theme') %>
  <%- include('../partials/mobile-fixes') %>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Gerência de Eventos</a>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <a href="/admin" class="active">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/admin/events" class="btn btn-secondary">Eventos</a>
        <a href="/admin/users" class="btn btn-secondary">Usuários</a>
        <% if (userEmail) { %><span class="session-pill"><%= userEmail %></span><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/logout" style="display:inline">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-logout">Sair</button>
        </form>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="danger-card">
      <h1>Restaurar Backup</h1>
      <p>Esta ação irá <strong>SUBSTITUIR</strong> o banco de dados atual e os arquivos enviados (uploads) pelos conteúdos do backup selecionado.</p>
      <p class="warning">O arquivo deve ser um ZIP gerado pelo botão "Baixar Backup" deste sistema (contém artigos.db e uploads/). Antes da substituição, uma cópia de segurança do banco atual é criada e removida após o sucesso; em caso de falha, o estado anterior é restaurado automaticamente.</p>
      <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="error-msg"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/backup/restore" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <input type="file" class="file-drop" id="backupFile" name="backup_file" accept=".zip,application/zip,application/x-zip-compressed" required>
        <br>
        <input type="text" class="danger-input" id="confirm" name="confirm" placeholder='Digite RESTAURAR para confirmar' autocomplete="off">
        <br>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-warn" id="submitBtn" disabled>Confirmar Restauração</button>
      </form>
      <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="btn-back">&larr; Voltar ao Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script nonce="<%= cspNonce %>">
    (function() {
      const confirmInput = document.getElementById('confirm');
      const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submitBtn');
      const fileInput = document.getElementById('backupFile');
      const form = document.querySelector('form[action="/admin/backup/restore"]');

      function refresh() {
        submitBtn.disabled = !(confirmInput.value === 'RESTAURAR' && fileInput.files.length > 0);
      }

      confirmInput.addEventListener('input', refresh);
      fileInput.addEventListener('change', refresh);

      confirmInput.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
        if (e.key === 'Enter') {
          e.preventDefault();
        }
      });

      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        if (confirmInput.value !== 'RESTAURAR' || fileInput.files.length === 0) {
          e.preventDefault();
          submitBtn.disabled = true;
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>
<%- include("../partials/csrf-inject") %>
  </body>
</html>
